sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Frontend / HTTP Client
    participant Main as backend/app/main.py
    participant Config as backend/app/core/config.py
    participant Loader as backend/app/core/loader.py (DataStore)
    participant Route as backend/app/api/routes_*.py
    participant Scoring as backend/app/services/scoring.py

    Note over Main,Loader: Startup Lifespan Event
    Main->>Config: Initialize Settings (evaluates DEBUG, data_dir)
    Main->>Loader: get_store() triggered
    Loader->>Loader: Hash data files & verify file signatures
    Loader->>Loader: Read CSVs, Parquet & YAML configuration into memory
    Main-->>Client: Server Listening at :8000 (OpenAPI /docs available)

    Note over Client,Scoring: Client Request Handling
    Client->>Route: POST /api/score (Custom weights payload)
    Route->>Loader: Depends(get_store) -> returns singleton DataStore
    Route->>Scoring: score_all_places(store, weights, year, place_type)
    Scoring->>Scoring: Dynamic weight re-normalization & matrix multiplication
    Scoring-->>Route: Computed scores, ranks, missing & inherited factor lists
    Route-->>Client: 200 OK (ScoreResponse Pydantic JSON)
